r disengage based on information</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Punish careless movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Outsmart opponents by denying vision and controlling space</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🌍 Battlefield Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Varied maps with terrain that affects sight and movement</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Urban ruins, forests, open fields and chokepoints</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Environmental objects that block vision and create ambush opportunities</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🎯 Designed For</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players who enjoy <strong>tactical gameplay</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fans of <strong>World of Tanks–style spotting mechanics</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategy-minded players who value positioning over reaction speed</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Indie and retro-inspired combat fans</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "A top-down tactical tank game focused on vision, positioning and battlefield awareness. See first — or be destroyed.", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376100/f2a067ae3aa3184920495049aeff1bce5822cd33/header.jpg?t=1773422512", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376100/f68e9ff7370b638fa7f220870fac0a15fa1fc19c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773422512", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4376100/f68e9ff7370b638fa7f220870fac0a15fa1fc19c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773422512", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> OS: Windows 7 / 8 / 10 / 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> CPU: 2.0 GHz Dual-Core oder besser<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:<